{"script":"s_4_10_2_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"护林人哈尔贝娜","text":"[show]嗯？那个炸弹制作好了吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"护林人哈尔贝娜","text":"[show]如果还没有的话，就等制作好之后再来找我吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"护林人哈尔贝娜","text":"[show]并非是我冷漠，而是因为目前猎场有很多麻烦的事情需要去处理，我的时间并不多，希望你们能理解。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[show]（还是先把一个燃烧炼金炸弹制作好再过来吧。）[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"（提交道具）"}